# Audio pipeline

- MediaRecorder capture MIME is browser-dependent — do not assume native WAV/MP3 from the recorder.
- Hard max **10 minutes**; warnings at 5 / 8 / 9 min (`src/lib/config/recording.ts`).
- Waveform peaks must come from real PCM (worker min/max buckets). Never invent decorative waveforms.
- Keep decode/render/encode in `$lib/audio/*`; UI only displays and dispatches.
- Prefer extending `createCaptureSession` / `captureController` over a parallel recorder.
- Peak overview generation lives in `$lib/audio/peaks` + `peaks.worker.ts` (PKS1 OPFS binary). Extend there; do not invent a second peak format.
- Recipe render lives in `$lib/audio/render`. WAV/MP3 export lives in `$lib/audio/encode` (+ `mp3.worker.ts`); do not rehome encoders into UI or upload adapters.
